<title>FINLAND: STOCKMANN JUNE SALES RISE 11 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>STOCKMANN JUNE SALES RISE 11 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Stockmann said</p>
<p>in a statement on Thursday its sales in June rose 11 percent to</p>
<p>601.0 million markka from 542.4 million in June last year.</p>
<p>Its January-June sales rose 13 percent year-on-year to 3.96</p>
<p>billion markka from 3.51 billion a year earlier, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
